'''Hangar 3-5''',<ref name="Peli Motto DB">{{Databank|peli-motto|Peli Motto}}</ref> also known as '''bay three-five''' or '''Peli Motto's hangar''',<ref name="S2GN">[[The Mandalorian – The Graphic Novel of Season 2|''The Mandalorian'' – The Graphic Novel of Season 2]]</ref> was a [[Mos Eisley]] [[Hangar|docking bay]] that was used by [[Din Djarin]] during a visit to [[Tatooine]]<ref name="Chapter 5" /> in [[9 ABY]].<ref name="Date">{{MandoDate|5}}</ref> [[Peli Motto]] worked as a [[Technician|mechanic]] there with her crew, including three [[DUM-series pit droid]]s, [[R5-D4]], a [[WED-15 Treadwell droid]],<ref name="Chapter 5" /> a [[MPH power droid]],<ref name="Chapter 9">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 9: The Marshal}}</ref> and [[BD-72]].<ref name="Return of the Mandalorian">{{BOBF|Chapter 5: Return of the Mandalorian}}</ref>

